meta {
  name: 06_ReAddingRestoresEstatePackages
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  Scenario: Adding an administrator again restores estate packages they removed

    Given the assistant is not an administrator for the bostyrer
    And the bostyrer adds the assistant
    When the assistant removes konkursbo-skrivetilgang from themselves on an estate
    Then the assistant no longer holds that package from the estate
    When the bostyrer adds the assistant again, with the last name in lower case
    Then the assistant holds all three estate packages from the estate again
    And the assistant is revoked as cleanup

    The assistant can drop a package through the ordinary connections API because estate
    access is a plain rightholder connection. Adding again grants whatever is missing.
}
